]\n697:            (let [t (nth v pc), kinds (tuple-kinds t)]\n719:(defn well-formed-image?\n812:  \"S3's second scope check, over and above `well-formed-image?`'s\n818:   here even though `well-formed-image?` alone would accept it.\n852:  (or (well-formed-image? v) (scope-defect v)))\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
